{{GM|$Craft|$Clothes & Equipment|$Armor & Helmets|$Beaver Wrist Guards}}

{{PAGENAME}} is a piece of hand [[:Category:Armor|armor]] that give bonus to [[AGI|Agility]] and [[Swimming]]. It equips to the [[Equipment Screen|equipment slot]] 5L.

Although they equip to the Hands slot, 4L, in your Equipment screen, they do not count as [[Gloves]] and as such don't reduce/eliminate hazards like Nettle Burn from picking stinging nettle or Quill'd from picking up/killing hedgehogs.

==Quality==

* [[{{PAGENAME}}]] Quality is Average Ingredients and is [[softcap|softcapped]] by <math>\sqrt[2]{Dexterity*Sewing}</math>.

